const name=(n)=>kids(n).map(set=>kids(set).map(a=>{const [o,val]=kids(a);return (NAMES[oid(o)]||oid(o))+'='+str(val);}).join('+')).join(', ');
const SIG={'1.2.840.113549.1.1.5':'sha1WithRSAEncryption','1.2.840.113549.1.1.11':'sha256WithRSAEncryption','1.2.840.113549.1.1.12':'sha384WithRSAEncryption','1.2.840.113549.1.1.13':'sha512WithRSAEncryption','1.2.840.10045.4.3.2':'ecdsa-with-SHA256','1.2.840.10045.4.3.3':'ecdsa-with-SHA384','1.3.101.112':'Ed25519','1.2.840.113549.1.1.4':'md5WithRSAEncryption'};
const time=(x)=>{const t=str(x);const g=x.tag===0x18;const y=g?t.slice(0,4):(+t.slice(0,2)>=50?'19':'20')+t.slice(0,2);const r=g?t.slice(4):t.slice(2);return new Date(Date.UTC(+y,+r.slice(0,2)-1,+r.slice(2,4),+r.slice(4,6),+r.slice(6,8),+(r.slice(8,10)||0)));};
